Package: tidalunar
Version: {VERSION}
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: {ARCH}
Maintainer: Brskt <contact@ancelade.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libnss3, libgbm1, libasound2, libxrandr2, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxfixes3, libxkbcommon0, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libcups2, libdbus-1-3, libatk1.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0, libdrm2, libnspr4, libgtk-3-0, zstd
Recommends: apparmor (>= 4.0~)
Description: Native TIDAL desktop client
 TidaLunar is a Rust desktop wrapper around CEF (Chromium Embedded Framework)
 that hosts TIDAL's web app with native window decorations, system tray,
 plugin sandboxing via Bun, and TIDAL Connect receiver support.
 .
 The .deb ships a small system bootstrap (sandbox helper, AppArmor profile,
 launcher) and extracts the application payload to ~/.local/share/tidalunar/
 on first launch. In-app updates apply silently to user home.
